        </p>
        <div class="rubric-fix">
          <span class="fix-good">Forma correcta:</span>
          <code>«Sea k ∈ ℤ...» o «Para todo x ∈ ℝ \ &#123;0&#125;...»</code>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rubric-card is-error">
        <div class="rubric-top">
          <span class="rubric-badge">ERROR FRECUENTE 02</span>
          <h3>El Abuso de la Flecha (⟹)</h3>
